OL,3,GNEWSARising fuel costs hitting
OL,4,Abusinesses and customers
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses and consumers in a town say
OL,7,Fsoaring fuel prices are having a
OL,8,Fgrowing impact on both their day-to-day
OL,9,Foperations and spending power.
OL,11,FHayle in Cornwall is home to a range of
OL,12,Findependent businesses that rely on
OL,13,Fregular deliveries, tourism and
OL,14,Fcustomers travelling from across the
OL,15,Fregion.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
