OL,3,GNEWSARising fuel costs hitting
OL,4,Abusinesses and customers
OL,5,
OL,6,FPetrol prices rose to an average of
OL,7,F161.3p per litre between July and
OL,8,FAugust, according to the Office for
OL,9,FNational Statistics (ONS), the highest
OL,10,Flevel recorded since November 2022, and
OL,11,Fdiesel is expected to top #2 per litre
OL,12,Fin the coming days
OL,14,FMark Nicholas, who runs flower shop The
OL,15,FBig Pink Tree, said: "The fuel increase
OL,16,Fhas really affected really how far we
OL,17,Fcan deliver to serve our customer
OL,18,Fbase."
